==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|kné|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|knewan|lang=is}}, originally from {{proto|Indo-European|ǵónu|lang=is}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kʰnjɛː/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ɛː|lang=is}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|n|knés|kné}}

# {{archaic|or|poetic|lang=is}} a [[knee]]{{jump|is|knee|s}}

====Declension====
{{Icelandic declension hk sb 06 é|kn}}

